    "title": "Nicole Jones Wadsworth Attends Christening at Austal USA for USNS Solomon Atkinson - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Staff Editor ,\n17 hours ago Nicole Jones Wadsworth, candidate for Lieutenant Governor, joined community leaders, members of the Atkinson family, and shipbuilders on Saturday for the christening ceremony of the USNS Solomon Atkinson (T-ATS 12) at Austal USA in Mobile, Alabama, a moment that honored service, sacrifice, and the enduring strength of America’s maritime tradition. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
